  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "What time?",
   "texto": [
    "**À quelle heure ?** = what time? It is answered with **à**: **à huit heures**.",
    "**En retard** = late: **Je suis en retard** (I am late). **Maintenant** = now.",
    "In conversation, **on** usually replaces **nous** («We»), but the verb is conjugated in third person singular: **On déjeune ensemble ?** (do we eat together?). In other contexts it can also mean «one» or «se»."
